{"id":"0afef8eeccddc023","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection.md","title":"ZPP 等于 RP 与 coRP 的交","display":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection — ZPP 等于 RP 与 coRP 的交","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection","aliases":["73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection"],"display":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection — ZPP 等于 RP 与 coRP 的交","depends_on":["[[73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time]]","[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.7, Theorem 11.17, print pp. 510–511; PDF pp. 532–533","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-zpp-rp-intersection — ZPP 等于 RP 与 coRP 的交"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2768770bc528cab8\" href=\"?note=2768770bc528cab8\" title=\"73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time\">73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c185b4536ca59db\" href=\"?note=1c185b4536ca59db\" title=\"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp\">73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"29f67a62b22dd6a8\" href=\"?note=29f67a62b22dd6a8\" title=\"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws\">73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.7, Theorem 11.17, print pp. 510–511; PDF pp. 532–533"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>所有语言以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathbf2^*\\)</span> 为载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RP},\\mathsf{coRP},\\mathsf{ZPP}\">\\(\\mathsf{RP},\\mathsf{coRP},\\mathsf{ZPP}\\)</span> 采用已列依赖中的同一概率语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ZPP}=\\mathsf{RP}\\cap\\mathsf{coRP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ZPP}=\\mathsf{RP}\\cap\\mathsf{coRP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从交到 ZPP：交替运行 L 与补语言的 RP 机，任何一次接受便给出相应的正确答案；每轮成功概率至少 1/2，轮数的尾概率≤2⁻ʳ，所以总期望时间至多每轮统一时间界的两倍，并以概率一停机。反向：把期望≤p(n) 的零错误机截断于 2p(n) 步，超时视为拒绝；尾界保证正实例至少一半成功。分别把两种确定答案作为接受，可识别 L 及其补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time","status":"resolved","id":"2768770bc528cab8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-error-expected-polynomial-time]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","status":"resolved","id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws","status":"resolved","id":"29f67a62b22dd6a8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RP},\\mathsf{coRP},\\mathsf{ZPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ZPP}=\\mathsf{RP}\\cap\\mathsf{coRP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"2b052d522e4d30df","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；$\\mathsf{ZPP},\\mathsf{RP},\\mathsf{coRP}$ 采用 [[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]]。"},{"id":"772657e2b19db9ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"两台确定机仅在第 6 分量转移函数上可不同；每一步用一个新的公平比特选择转移，相同转移可忽略该比特。该本地模型模拟第三版随机带：第一次访问某格时掷币并记录，以后重访读取同一记录；反向用随机带上的新格供每步选择。存储与查询记录有多项式开销，故保持 RP 的最坏多项式界。对 ZPP 不能直接把逐路径的多项式开销作用于期望：有限的一阶矩不保证高阶矩有限。应先把期望多项式零错误机截断为 L 与补语言的两个 RP 检验，进行有界模拟，再用 [[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]] 的独立重试恢复期望多项式零错误机。反向从新比特模型到随机带可逐步常数开销模拟。它不是声称教材曾给出这个二元组。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection|ZPP 等于 RP 与 coRP 的交]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"1b2ccbfd02ba2f92","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf P,\\mathsf{NP}$ 为本册二进制多带时间类；随机类采用 [[73-thm-zpp-rp-intersection]] 的语义。"}],"outgoing":["2768770bc528cab8","1c185b4536ca59db","29f67a62b22dd6a8"]}